department with a self-limiting episode of seizure.
He is known to have epilepsy which has been well-
controlled with carbamazepine for the last 12
months. Full investigations including blood tests
and CT scan of the head reveals no apparent cause
for the seizure. The patient is keen to know about
the driving restriction. Which one of the following
